Basketball-Bundesliga: Clear kick-off successes for Berlin and Oldenburg
ALBA Berlin has started with a clear victory in the new season of the Basketball Bundesliga.
Against Science City Jena, the runner-up won easily with 112:55 (52:31) and offered a convincing game over 40 minutes.
Newcomer Rokas Giedraitis was top scorer of the dominating Berliners with 20 points.
Johannes Thiemann (18 points), who was signed from Ludwigsburg, also showed an appealing performance in front of 9113 spectators on his competitive debut.
