Augustine Rubit was the best thrower among the guests with 24 points.
Würzburg professional Gabriel Olaseni scored 14 points.
Last year's playoff semi-finalist MHP Riesen Ludwigsburg defeated the Fraport Skyliners from Frankfurt with 83:76 (41:34).
New international Karim Jallow was the most accurate shooter with 24 points on the team of coach John Patrick.
