Kerber won at the China Open 6:2, 6:2 against Frenchwoman Kristina Mladenovic.
The next opponent of the world ranking third is either Yulia Putintseva from Kazakhsten or the Spaniard Carla Suárez Navarro.
Siegemund led 6:3, 4:2 against Darja Kassatkina, when the number #13 Russian gave up.
