Helicopter crashed in Kottingbrunn
On landing, an accident occurred at the airfield.
The four inmates were slightly injured.
Around 2 p.m. on Sunday at the airfield in Kottingbrunn, a drama occurred.
During the landing of a helicopter, turbulence occurred, as the police confirmed to oe24.
The heli was captured by a gust of wind, crashed to the ground and came to a standstill laterally.
Police, rescue and firefighters were immediately notified.
With a large squad, the forces came to the accident site.
The ÖAMTC emergency medical helicopter was also called as a precaution.
Occupant only slightly injured
Luckily, it all turned out to be largely harmless.
There's only one property damage.
The four occupants were only slightly injured and were able to return home on their own.
The exact circumstances regarding the accident have not yet been clarified and the subject of the investigation.
