But before and later, Wulff was a guest there.
Academy director Udo Hahn credited him when he proudly said: "All the federal presidents and chancellors were already with us." That celebrities appear again and again at the academy in Tutzing Castle, but was also an issue at the presentation of the annual program.
At the end of October, songwriter Konstantin Wecker participates in a conference on spiritual experience from a philosophical perspective, on September 29 the writer Frido Mann is at a conference about his grandfather Thomas Mann.
