"The pension isn't sure!" reads a conference title.
"SOS on Europe's borders" - this is how the academy describes the "risky and deadly route across the Mediterranean."
"And to a meeting on Syria: "Barbarism without limit".
Weapon deals, destruction, torture, death – the war mocks every humane idea.”
The spectrum ranges from structural racism in society to scissors between rich and poor to the radical change of work through digitization.
