One dead in glider accident at Essen/Mülheim airport
There has been a fatal accident at Mülheim/Essen airport.
A glider crashed in a parking lot at Mülheim/Essen airport on Sunday.
The pilot died in the accident.
A fatal accident occurred near Mülheim/Essen airport on Sunday.
As the "Westdeutsche Allgemeine Zeitung" reports, a glider had crashed in the exhibition parking lot at the airport.
The pilot died.
As the "WAZ" further reports, the flight student was alone on board - the flier is said to be a single-seater.
The plane was already in the landing approach at the time of the accident.
The crash site is located not far from a marquee on the airport grounds.
