Hannes Aigner has won the gold medal at the conclusion of the canoe slalom World Championship in Rio de Janeiro.
The 29-year-old made a perfect run on the Olympic track on Sunday.
Two years ago, he had still missed Olympic bronze by three hundredths of a second.
I was well prepared, already had enough rides here at the facility and it was all right today," said the Olympic third of London 2012.
