The Gauting police inspection announces the first burglary attempt of this autumn to a single-family home.
Luckily, the perpetrators failed.
The days are getting shorter - that's what burglars want to make use of again.
So the police inspection Gauting reported the first burglary attempt of this autumn yesterday.
It is thanks to the alarm system that that it remained when trying the single-family house on Königswieser Straße.
It started when the perpetrators laid hands shortly before 8 p.m. on Friday.
The burglars suspected that the residents weren’t at home.
