So he had accused German Chancellor Angela Merkel (CDU) of "stumbling" on the issue.
"That was your Schabowski moment," he said, alluding to Günter Schabowski's accidental proclamation of the GDR border opening.
Since October 1, 2017, same-sex couples have been able to get married just like heterosexuals.
Previously, they had been able to register their civil partnership since 2001, but there was no equality with marriage, for example on adoption law.
